test: raw preprocessor and preformatted regions preserve their contents
Control-looking content inside an opaque block does not create sections.
-- input.1 --
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
.SH literal text
  demo --help
.EE
.nf
first \fBline\fR
.fi
.TS
l l.
Name	Value
.TE
.EQ
x sup 2
.EN
.PS
box "hello"
.PE
.[
%A Example Author
.]
